# MédiSync POC — Cursor Rules
# Interactive Connected Pill Dispenser Prototype
# Version: 1.0 | Stack: React + TypeScript + Vite + R3F + Zustand + Tailwind

## PROJECT OVERVIEW
MédiSync is a POC demonstrating a connected smart pill dispenser ecosystem
with 4 user roles: Patient, Carer (Aidant), Pharmacist, Doctor.
Goal: Show the product in action, not just describe it.

---

## TECH STACK (LOCKED)

| Layer         | Technology                        | Version  |
|---------------|-----------------------------------|----------|
| Framework     | React + TypeScript                | 18 + 5   |
| Build tool    | Vite                              | 5.x      |
| 3D Engine     | React Three Fiber + Three.js      | 8.x      |
| 3D Helpers    | @react-three/drei                 | 9.x      |
| State         | Zustand                           | 4.x      |
| Animations    | Framer Motion                     | 11.x     |
| Styling       | Tailwind CSS                      | 3.x      |
| Audio         | Howler.js                         | 2.x      |
| Charts        | Recharts                          | 2.x      |

DO NOT add other libraries without explicit user approval.
DO NOT use Redux, MobX, or Context API for global state — use Zustand only.
DO NOT use CSS Modules — use Tailwind utility classes only.

