### Color Palette
```css
--navy-900: #060d1f    /* Background */
--navy-800: #0a1628    /* Panel background */
--navy-700: #0f1f3d    /* Elevated panel */
--medical-blue: #00b4d8  /* Primary accent */
--medical-teal: #48cae4  /* Secondary accent */
--status-taken: #06d6a0  /* Green — medication taken */
--status-upcoming: #ffd166  /* Yellow — upcoming dose */
--status-missed: #ef476f    /* Red — missed dose / alert */
--status-locked: #4a5568    /* Gray — compartment locked */
--text-primary: #f1f5f9
--text-secondary: #94a3b8
```

### Typography Scale
- Display: text-4xl font-bold (scene titles)
- Heading: text-2xl font-semibold (section titles)
- Body: text-base font-normal
- Label: text-sm font-medium
- Micro: text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide

### Spacing
- Use 4px base grid (Tailwind default)
- Panels: p-6 (24px inner padding)
- Cards: p-4 (16px inner padding)
- Section gaps: gap-6

